          "description": "This unit cannot be sent to the reinforcements from the battlefield. If this unit would be defeated by an enemy attack or a status effect while having more than 1 HP, it instead survives with 1 HP.\n\nThis unit's attacks ignore any effects of non-boss enemies that would prevent targets from being defeated.\n\nEach time this unit takes damage from an attack while burning or poisoned and survives until after the end of the turn with more than 1 HP, this unit will get the turn by having its TU reduced to 0 and become burned. This extra turn may be interrupted by other effects that influence the turn order (e.g. other stuns targeting the lowest TU target). This TU reduction may trigger before or after other effects that adjust the turn order. This is not considered a Counter Skin type effect."
        }
      },
      "OffWithTheirHeadsPassiveAQueenHeartsRegularBoss": {
        "id": "OffWithTheirHeadsPassiveAQueenHeartsRegularBoss",
        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "Take Their Heads",
          "description": "This unit cannot be defeated by damage from Burn status effects.\n\nWhen this unit defeats a non-conjured enemy with an attack, all other allies on the battlefield will be given the next turns by reducing their current TU. Effects that influence TU order may interrupt the extra turn (e.g. Stuns targeting the lowest TU target).\n\nThis unit enters battle with Mega Healing Burn for 100TU. Then all allies on the battlefield are granted Poison Wards, and Stun Wards.\n\nWhile this unit is on the battlefield, whenever a unit on the battlefield is defeated or sacrificed by any source, so long as this unit is not defeated or sacrificed at the same time, all allies on the battlefield are Purified (removes negative status effects like sleep, burn or poison), and then burned.\n\nA unit with Mega Healing Burn will heal after each turn at 20 times the rate as Healing Burn. This will overwrite other status effects including Healing Burn on the user, cannot be overwritten by Burn, Poison or Sleep status effects, and cannot be Purified. Any unit that deals damage to or is dealt damage by a unit with Mega Healing Burn will gain the Burn status effect. A unit with Mega Healing Burn will be granted Healing Burn for 300TU when Mega Healing Burn expires."
        }
      }
